---
import PageHero from './PageHero.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { liveContact } from '../data/site';
---
<PageHero title="Let’s put the requirement in focus." category="Contact Hanpars" description="A product, a project or a regulatory question. Start with the brief and continue through our existing contact channel." action="Open the existing contact form" href={liveContact}/>
<section class="section"><div class="container contact-layout">
  <div class="brief-panel" id="enquiry"><span class="eyebrow">01 / PREPARE YOUR ENQUIRY</span><h2>What can we discuss?</h2><p>Build a short brief here, then copy it into the existing Hanpars contact form. This step prepares your message—it does not send it.</p>
    <div class="enquiry-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Enquiry type"><button id="enquiry-sourcing" type="button" class="enquiry-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="brief-form" data-enquiry-type="sourcing">Product sourcing</button><button id="enquiry-regulatory" type="button" class="enquiry-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="brief-form" data-enquiry-type="regulatory" tabindex="-1">Regulatory Affairs</button><button id="enquiry-cdmo" type="button" class="enquiry-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="brief-form" data-enquiry-type="cdmo" tabindex="-1">FDF CDMO</button></div>
    <form id="brief-form" aria-labelledby="enquiry-sourcing" role="tabpanel">
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-field full"><label for="brief-product" data-product-label>Product or ingredient name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="brief-product" name="product" placeholder="e.g. the INN, API or ingredient you need" required maxlength="500"/><span class="form-hint">Use the product reference or describe your project.</span></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="brief-spec" data-spec-label>Specification, grade or strength</label><input id="brief-spec" name="specification" placeholder="Your required specification" maxlength="500"/></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="brief-quantity" data-quantity-label>Quantity or project scale</label><input id="brief-quantity" name="quantity" placeholder="Include units, if known" maxlength="300"/></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="brief-market">Target market / destination</label><input id="brief-market" name="market" placeholder="The market relevant to your request" maxlength="300"/></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="brief-timing">Requested timing</label><input id="brief-timing" name="timing" placeholder="Your preferred timeframe" maxlength="300"/></div>
        <div class="form-field full"><label for="brief-message" data-message-label>Documentation needs & other details</label><textarea id="brief-message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us about specifications, documentation, dossier status or the support you need." maxlength="5000" rows="4"></textarea></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-actions"><button class="button button-navy" type="submit" data-prepare-brief disabled>Prepare my enquiry brief<Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></button><a class="button button-outline" href={liveContact} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Skip to the contact form<Icon name="diagonal" size={17}/></a></div>
      <noscript><p class="form-hint">Brief preparation requires JavaScript. Use the existing contact form to send your enquiry.</p></noscript>
      <p class="form-disclaimer">Your brief is prepared in this browser and is not submitted or stored by this page. Please don’t include confidential personal or medical information. No quotation, availability or timeline is confirmed by preparing a brief.</p>
    </form>
    <div class="brief-result" id="brief-result" aria-live="polite" hidden><span class="eyebrow">02 / CONTINUE THE CONVERSATION</span><h3>Your enquiry brief is ready.</h3><p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)">Copy the brief and paste it into the message field on our existing contact form. Nothing has been sent yet.</p><pre id="brief-text"></pre><div class="brief-actions"><button class="button button-outline" type="button" id="copy-brief"><Icon name="copy" size={15}/>Copy brief</button><button class="button button-outline" type="button" id="download-brief"><Icon name="download" size={15}/>Download brief</button><a class="button button-sky" href={liveContact} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Hanpars contact form<Icon name="diagonal" size={15}/></a></div><p class="result-status" id="brief-status" role="status"></p></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="contact-aside"><span class="eyebrow">THE EXISTING HANPARS CHANNEL</span><h3>A conversation, not a generic form.</h3><p>Use the contact form on hanpars.com to send your prepared enquiry through the existing channel.</p><a class="text-link" href={liveContact} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the contact channel<Icon name="diagonal" size={16}/></a><div class="contact-detail"><Icon name="phone" size={21}/><div><strong>Phone</strong><a href="tel:+982188856347">+98 21 8885 6347</a></div></div><div class="contact-detail"><Icon name="pin" size={21}/><div><strong>Published office details</strong><p>HANIYA PARSAN DAROU<br/>3rd floor, No. 326, Zafar st,<br/>Africa Boulvard, Tehran, Iran<br/>Zip Code: 1968734974</p></div></div><div class="contact-detail"><Icon name="clock" size={21}/><div><strong>Published office hours</strong><p>09:00 – 17:00</p><span class="form-hint">Confirm the schedule when arranging a visit.</span></div></div></aside>
</div></section>
